      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Kol 3:20—4:1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaana, mworobere abazaire baanyu omuri Mukama, ahakuba nikyo kihikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiina sho na nyoko; (ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'okubanza ekirimu okuraganisibwa) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obone kuba gye, okahangaara omu nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.20+DEU.6.21+DEU.6.22+DEU.6.23+DEU.6.24+DEU.6.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 6:20-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naimwe baishebo, murekye kugwisa kubi abaana baanyu, kureka mubarere, nimubategyeka gye, kandi nimubeegyeseza omuri Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abahuuku, mworobere bakama baanyu ab'omu nsi, nk'abarikworobera Kristo, mubatiine nimutetema n'omutima ogutaine buryarya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutabakorera ahabw'okureebwa, nk'abarikwenda kusiimwa abantu, kureka nk'abahuuku ba Kristo abakora ebi Ruhanga akunda, nimukora mwihire aha mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubakorere n'omutima murungi, nk'abarikukorera Mukama, ti nk'abarikukorera abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 5:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nimumanya ngu ekirungi kyona eki omuntu akora, aryakiihurwa Mukama, yaaba muhuuku nari ow'obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.19.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 19:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi imwe bakama baabo, naimwe mube nikwo mwabatwaza, murekye kubatiinisa, nimumanya ngu Mukama waanyu mwembi ari omu iguru, kandi tashoroora mu bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 16:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eky'aha muheru, mube abahamire omuri Mukama n'omubushoboorozi bw'amaani ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujware eby'okurwanisa byona ebya Ruhanga, mubone kwemerera mutasingwirwe bugobya bwa Sitaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba titurikufukaana n'abaine omubiri n'eshagama, kureka niturwana n'ebirikutegyeka n'ebiine obushoboorozi n'ebirikutwara ensi egi omu busingye obu obw'omwirima, kandi niturwana n'amahe g'emyoyo emibi ey'omu myanya y'omu iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo mukwate eby'okurwanisa byona ebya Ruhanga, mubone kuguma aha izooba ribi; kandi, ku muriheza kukora byona, mwemerere muhamire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 59:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tes 5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'ekyo mwemerere, mwezirikire amazima omu nda nk'orukoba, mujwaire eky'okuhikiirira nk'ekyoma ky'okwekingiza omu kifuba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 52:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mujwaire enkaito ez'okweteekateeka kugamba engiri y'obusingye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.5.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 5:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi ahari ebyo byona mukwatireho engabo y'okwikiriza, ei murikubaasa kuraarisa emyambi y'omuriro yoona ey'Omubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tes 5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi mujware enkofiira ey'okujunwa, na rurara y'Omwoyo, nikyo kigambo kya Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kol 4:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mushabire omu Mwoyo obutoosha omu kushaba kw'emiringo yoona n'okweshengyereza, nimubyezirikia n'okugumisiriza kwona, nimushabira abarikwera boona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi naanye munshabire, mbone kuheebwa okugamba n'obumanzi, hoona ahi ndyashamiza akanwa kangye okumanyisa enaama y'engiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 5:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ei ndi entumwa yaayo omu nkomo, ngigambe n'obumanzi, nk'oku kinshemereire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
